{{Quote|The Geonosian hives leaned heavily into crystalline research of their own, importing magmatic crystals by the ton. They even outsourced one off shoot&mdash;code name Hammertong&mdash; to a facility on the crystal planet of Mygeeto.|Colonel Haxen Delto, to General Davits Draven in a report of past Geonosian research of an ultimate weapon|<ref name="Rebel Files" />}}
During research into crystalline properties and [[crystal]]s, the [[Geonosian hive]]s operated a '''facility''' on the crystal [[planet]] of [[Mygeeto]]. When conducting research on a crystal codenamed [[Hammertong]], the [[Geonosian]]s outsourced it to the facility. The facility was be mentioned [[Standard year|years]] later by [[Colonel]] [[Haxen Delto]] to [[General]] [[Davits Draven]] of the [[Rebel Alliance Intelligence Service|intelligence branch]] of the [[Alliance to Restore the Republic]], when Delto sent a report to Draven about the relationship between Geonosians and a supposed [[DS-1 Orbital Battle Station|Ultimate Weapon]], and the activities that the [[Galactic Empire]] were taking part in to possibly build a [[superweapon]].<ref name="Rebel Files" />

